# coder plugin manifest — Claude plugins the autonomous loop installs before it
# runs this repo's `/implement`. The loop installs whatever is listed here into
# its container's ~/.claude (so the image itself stays repo-agnostic; your repo's
# plugin needs live here, with the rest of your process artifacts).
#
# One plugin per line:
#     <plugin>@<marketplace>  <marketplace-git-url>
#   - the left token is passed to `claude plugin install`
#   - the right token is passed to `claude plugin marketplace add`
# Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored. Delete this file entirely
# if your `/implement` needs no plugins.
#
# Example — uncomment / edit for your repo (this one adds Anthropic's
# frontend-design plugin from the official public marketplace):
#
# frontend-design@claude-plugins-official  https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official.git
